            "processedContentHtml": "\n                  <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <!-- CARD 1: PALCO DO AI SPEECH COACH -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 text-rose-950 space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-rose-200\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"mic\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#E11D48]\"></i>\n                          🎙️ AI Speech Coach: O Teste do Gringo (0 a 10)\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-rose-700 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-rose-300\">Speaking Autônomo</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <p class=\"text-xs text-rose-900 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Chegou a hora de falar com o inglês que você tem <b>HOJE, no Agora</b>. Zero obrigação de decorar! Abra o Training Player na aba <b>Look & Retell</b>, aperte o microfone radiante e reconte a manhã da Grazi usando as perguntas-guia abaixo como roteiro mental.\n                      </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- CARD 2: AS 14 PERGUNTAS-GUIA VISUAIS DE RECONTO -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-4\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"list-ordered\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#E11D48]\"></i>\n                          Perguntas-Guia de Apoio para Recontar a História\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-500 bg-stone-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">Roteiro Visual</span>\n                      </div>\n\n                      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 text-xs text-slate-800\">\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">1. What day of the week is it?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">2. What season of the year is it?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">3. What is the weather like in Brasília?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">4. Does Grazi wake up late on Saturdays?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">5. Where does Grazi go to make breakfast?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">6. How does Grazi like her coffee?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">7. What does she make to eat for breakfast?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">8. What does she pick up out of the fridge?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">9. What does she put on the table to set it up?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">10. Where are Anna and Flavia at 8:00 AM?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">11. Why does Grazi go back upstairs?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">12. What does Grazi yell to the girls?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">13. What does Grazi pick up before running?</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC]\">\n                          <span class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F] block\">14. In your opinion: where in the world is Tom?</span>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- CARD 3: KEYWORDS DE ATIVAÇÃO -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"key\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#C68A36]\"></i>\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F]\">Keywords de Apoio para Conectar Ideias:</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-mono\">\n                        beautiful Saturday • Brasília • beginning of the fall • not so dry / hot • wakes up early • goes downstairs • black coffee • toasts & eggs • orange juice • carton of milk • sets up table • girls upstairs • puts on running shoes • yells breakfast is ready • runs out the door • where in the world is Tom?\n                      </p>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                ",
            "aiStatus": "published",
            "hasTrainingTrack": true,
            "trainingTrackId": "ms-legacy-03",
            "published": true
