            "rawScript": "",
            "processedContentHtml": "\n                  <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <!-- CARD 1: CHECKLIST DE TREINO -->\n                    <div class=\"p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 text-indigo-950 space-y-2\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"help-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#6366F1]\"></i>\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-900\">Mecânica de Treino • O Jogo de Formular Perguntas:</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-indigo-950 font-medium\">\n                        <b>[  ] Passo 1:</b> Ouça a frase de provocação na negativa ➔ <b>[  ] Passo 2:</b> Formule imediatamente a pergunta correspondente no reflexo antes do áudio responder!\n                      </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- CARD 2: AS 12 FRASES ESTÍMULO (SEM PERGUNTAS REVELADAS) -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-4\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"sparkles\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#6366F1]\"></i>\n                          12 Frases de Provocação (Listen & Ask)\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#6366F1] bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-indigo-200\">Sem Perguntas Reveladas</span>\n                      </div>\n\n                      <div class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 font-medium\">\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">1. It is not Sunday morning.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">2. It is not summer or winter.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">3. The weather is not terrible.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">4. Grazi does not wake up late.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">5. She does not stay upstairs.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">6. She does not like milk in her coffee.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">7. She does not make pancakes.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">8. She does not leave the juice outside.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">9. The girls are not in the kitchen.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">10. She does not whisper to the girls.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">11. Grazi is not going to sleep.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#FAF8F5] rounded-xl border border-[#EAE5DC] space-y-1\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0A192F]\">12. Tom is not at the breakfast table.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\">[ ] Formule sua pergunta: ___________________________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- CARD 3: SACADA DE LIDERANÇA EM CONVERSAS -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#FDF8F0] border border-[#C68A36]/40 text-[#0A192F] space-y-2\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i data-lucide=\"message-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#6366F1]\"></i>\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F]\">Por que Treinar Listen & Ask?</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Quem lidera e mantém conversas vivas em inglês é quem sabe perguntar com rapidez e ritmo. Ao ouvir uma afirmação/negação, seu cérebro deve disparar a pergunta sem passar pelo português!\n                      </p>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                ",
