            "processedContentHtml": "\n                  <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-4\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"book-open\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#C68A36]\"></i>\n                          Texto do Diálogo (Listen & Read)\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#C68A36] bg-[#FDF8F0] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#C68A36]/30\">Imersão Sonora em Diálogo</span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Chloe:</font></b> Hello everyone, and welcome to \"The Right Questions about Life,\" the podcast where we ask the things that really matter. Today, we have a very special guest, Graziela. Thank you for being here, Grazi!</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Grazi:</font></b> Thanks for having me, Chloe! I'm happy to be here.</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Chloe:</font></b> Grazi, let's start with a few questions about your personal life. You’re from Brasilia, right? And you're married to Tom?</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Grazi:</font></b> Yes, that's right. I live here with my husband and our two daughters, Anna and Flavia.</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Chloe:</font></b> That's lovely. So, Tom is an executive, correct? He works a lot, right?</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Grazi:</font></b> He does. He is a workaholic. He works many hours a week and sometimes on weekends.</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Chloe:</font></b> Wow, that sounds intense. Does that mean he travels for work?</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Grazi:</font></b> Yes, he has to fly to the USA every single month and stay there for about a week.</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Chloe:</font></b> I see. And what about your routine? I heard you wake up early. Is that true?</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Grazi:</font></b> Yes, every day at around 7 a.m.</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Grazi:</font></b> I jump in the pool, take a shower, have some breakfast, and then go to work at 9.</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Chloe:</font></b> Interesting! I know a little about you, but not about the girls. How old are they?</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Grazi:</font></b> Anna is 19 and Flavia is 15.</p>\n                        <p><b><font color=\"#1A56DB\">Chloe:</font></b> Well, that’s great. Thank you so much for sharing a bit of your life with us today!</p>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                ",
